 r←Test_Input_Misc_019(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;res;DT;double;parms;props;defMat;defMat2;this;that;counter;flag
⍝ Exercise "Input" with testMode←1 and autoPress←0
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Character1' '' 'Kai Jaeger'DT.Character 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Numeric1' '' 123 DT.Numeric 0 1 1

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←55 55
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.autoPress←0
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat ⍬ parms
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.∆OK'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp n.∆result[;1]≢'Kai Jaeger' 123  ⍝ Value Error?! Simply try →⎕LC

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
